{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wall_stone","model_identifier":"wall_stone","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# wall_stone\n\nStone wall: a straight segment one column (16 u) long along X, outer face toward -Z. End caps at both ends meet the next segment's cap to form a joint post. Stone: grey blocks, 3.6 m (128 u), one merlon, a walkway on top.\n\n- Footprint: 1 x 1 columns (16 x 16 units, 0.45 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -8..8, y 0..128, z -9..10 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material (repainted in Patch 5 for colour contrast).\n- Cubes: finished 6, construction_0 18, construction_33 24, construction_66 23, ruined 28 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `wall_stone_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 16 x 128 x 16 centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_wall_walk` at (0, 119, 2)"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"stone_wall#aba79d","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8,0,-8],"to":[8,118,8],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[84,0,100,118],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[100,0,116,118],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[116,0,132,118],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[132,0,148,118],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[188,0,204,16],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[204,0,220,16],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9b7a7220-01b2-590e-86c2-2267aa50d783"},{"name":"stone_wall_merlon#aba79d","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4,118,-8],"to":[4,128,-4],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,120,8,130],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[16,120,20,130],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8,120,16,130],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[20,120,24,130],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[92,120,100,124],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[100,120,108,124],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"609b0517-a710-5055-b2a0-88913a82fe5f"},{"name":"stone_wall_walk#9b978e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8,118,-4],"to":[8,119,8],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[108,120,124,121],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[140,120,152,121],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[124,120,140,121],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[152,120,164,121],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[220,0,236,12],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[236,0,252,12],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"84ac79bb-98f4-55eb-bded-13e81e137112"},{"name":"stone_wall_plinth#8f8b83","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.15,0,-9],"to":[8.15,6,9],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[60,120,76,126],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[24,120,42,126],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[76,120,92,126],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[42,120,60,126],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[156,0,172,18],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[172,0,188,18],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"bba27bdb-3470-5636-bc36-e58f46a9a989"},{"name":"stone_wall_cap_w#8f8b83","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror